{"id":"t4-imlak","tahap":"T4","nama":"Imlak (KAFA)","sk":"Imlak","ikon":"📝","warna":"#8E6C3A","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 4 (imlak kata nama dan hamzah)","semak":"pending teacher review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.67","sumber":"Year 4 imlak topics (the owner's e-book is pictures only); original notes and questions pending a teacher's review; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t4-imlak-1","nama":"Jamak taksir","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Pengertian"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Jamak taksir}} ialah kata nama jamak yang bentuk asalnya berubah. Ia tidak mengikut tambahan <span class=\"arab\">ونَ</span> atau <span class=\"arab\">اتٌ</span>."},{"j":"h","t":"Contoh"},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"arab\">كِتَابٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">كُتُبٌ</span> : buku","<span class=\"arab\">قَلَمٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">أَقْلَامٌ</span> : pen","<span class=\"arab\">وَلَدٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">أَوْلَادٌ</span> : budak lelaki","<span class=\"arab\">بَيْتٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">بُيُوتٌ</span> : rumah","<span class=\"arab\">رَجُلٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">رِجَالٌ</span> : lelaki","<span class=\"arab\">مَسْجِدٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">مَسَاجِدُ</span> : masjid","<span class=\"arab\">مَدْرَسَةٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">مَدَارِسُ</span> : sekolah","<span class=\"arab\">تِلْمِيذٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">تَلَامِيذُ</span> : murid","<span class=\"arab\">بَابٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">أَبْوَابٌ</span> : pintu","<span class=\"arab\">نَجْمٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">نُجُومٌ</span> : bintang","<span class=\"arab\">صَدِيقٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">أَصْدِقَاءُ</span> : kawan","<span class=\"arab\">شَجَرَةٌ</span> ← <span class=\"arab\">أَشْجَارٌ</span> : pokok"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Jamak taksir mesti dihafaz kerana bentuknya berbeza-beza."}],"glosari":[["Jamak taksir","Jamak yang bentuk asalnya berubah."],["Taksir","Pecah atau berubah."]]},{"id":"t4-imlak-2","nama":"Ta marbutah dan ta maftuhah","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ta marbutah <span class=\"arab\">ة</span>"},{"j":"l","t":["Ditulis di akhir kata nama muannath","Dibaca <span class=\"arab\">ه</span> apabila berhenti (waqaf)","Contoh: <span class=\"arab\">مَدْرَسَةٌ ، فَاطِمَةُ ، شَجَرَةٌ</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ta maftuhah <span class=\"arab\">ت</span>"},{"j":"l","t":["Ditulis panjang dan terbuka","Tetap dibaca <span class=\"arab\">ت</span> walaupun berhenti","Terdapat pada kata kerja dan jamak muannath salim","Contoh: <span class=\"arab\">بَيْتٌ ، كَتَبَتْ ، مُسْلِمَاتٌ</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Marbutah","Terikat atau tertutup."],["Maftuhah","Terbuka."],["Waqaf","Berhenti bacaan."]]},{"id":"t4-imlak-3","nama":"Hamzah wasal dan hamzah qata'","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Hamzah qata'"},{"j":"l","t":["Ditulis dengan tanda hamzah <span class=\"arab\">أ / إ</span>","Sentiasa dibaca sama ada di awal atau di tengah bacaan","Contoh: <span class=\"arab\">أَحْمَدُ ، إِسْلَامٌ ، أَكَلَ</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Hamzah wasal"},{"j":"l","t":["Ditulis alif tanpa tanda hamzah <span class=\"arab\">ا</span>","Dibaca di awal bacaan, tetapi tidak dibaca apabila disambung dengan perkataan sebelumnya","Contoh: <span class=\"arab\">اِسْمٌ ، اِبْنٌ ، الْكِتَابُ ، اِقْرَأْ</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Qata'","Putus; sentiasa dibaca."],["Wasal","Sambung; tidak dibaca apabila disambung."]]},{"id":"t4-imlak-4","nama":"Alif lam dalam tulisan","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Alif lam qamariyyah"},{"j":"l","t":["Huruf lam ditulis dengan tanda sukun <span class=\"arab\">الْ</span>","Huruf selepasnya tiada syaddah","Contoh: <span class=\"arab\">الْقَمَرُ ، الْكِتَابُ ، الْبَيْتُ</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Alif lam syamsiyyah"},{"j":"l","t":["Huruf lam ditulis tetapi tidak berbaris","Huruf selepasnya bertanda syaddah","Contoh: <span class=\"arab\">الشَّمْسُ ، النُّورُ ، الدَّرْسُ</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Walaupun lam syamsiyyah tidak dibaca, ia tetap ditulis."}],"glosari":[["Qamariyyah","Lam dibaca jelas dan bertanda sukun."],["Syamsiyyah","Lam tidak dibaca; huruf selepasnya bersyaddah."]]},{"id":"t4-imlak-5","nama":"Tanwin fathah dengan alif","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Cara menulis"},{"j":"l","t":["Tanwin fathah biasanya ditulis bersama alif tambahan di akhir perkataan: <span class=\"arab\">كِتَابًا ، قَلَمًا ، بَيْتًا</span>","Alif ini tidak dibaca semasa sambung, tetapi dibaca panjang apabila berhenti","Alif tidak ditambah selepas ta marbutah: <span class=\"arab\">مَدْرَسَةً</span>","Alif tidak ditambah selepas hamzah yang didahului alif: <span class=\"arab\">سَمَاءً</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Tanwin fathah","Dua baris di atas."],["Alif tambahan","Alif yang ditulis selepas tanwin fathah."]]},{"id":"t4-imlak-6","nama":"Ulang kaji imlak Tahun 4","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ringkasan"},{"j":"l","t":["Jamak taksir: bentuk asal berubah","Ta marbutah <span class=\"arab\">ة</span> dan ta maftuhah <span class=\"arab\">ت</span>","Hamzah qata' sentiasa dibaca; hamzah wasal tidak dibaca apabila disambung","Lam syamsiyyah tetap ditulis","Tanwin fathah ditulis bersama alif"]}],"glosari":[["Imlak","Menulis dengan ejaan yang betul."]]}]}